profile.LIGHT=Light
profile.BALANCED=Balanced
screen.SHADOWS=Near shadows
screen.WATER=Water
option.CAST_SHADOWS=Cast shadows
option.CAST_SHADOWS.comment=Draw Overworld opaque terrain and cutouts into a depth map. Switch off for maximum frame rate.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow map size
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Side length in pixels. Applies while cast shadows are enabled.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow radius
option.shadowDistance.comment=Distance in blocks. A shorter radius concentrates detail and reduces the amount of geometry drawn.
option.WATER_SKY=Sky reflection
option.WATER_SKY.comment=Reflect the sky palette on exposed water. The reflection grows stronger at grazing angles.
option.WATER_RIPPLES=Ripples
option.WATER_RIPPLES.comment=Two waves vary water brightness and the reflection angle. Fades in the distance.
option.COPPER_EDGE=Copper edge
option.COPPER_EDGE.comment=Warm light grazes the upper edge of sunward masonry at dawn and dusk. Fades before the edge becomes subpixel.
option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud layer
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Painted clouds share their shape with the water reflection. The highest setting also shades the ground as clouds drift overhead.
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Game clouds
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=Painted sky
value.CLOUD_STYLE.2=Sky and ground shade
option.WATER_DEPTH=Shoreline depth
option.WATER_DEPTH.comment=Read the opaque depth behind water for clear shallows and darker pools. Switch off to avoid the extra depth read.
option.FOLIAGE_WIND=Wind in foliage
option.FOLIAGE_WIND.comment=Leaves stir and grass bends from the base. The same motion is used when drawing nearby shadows.
